local _, AP = ...

--[[ Cozy Sleeping Bag: the quest chain that ends with the Cozy Sleeping Bag (lie
	in it for more experience for an hour), one route for each faction. The Alliance
	starts in Westfall and goes to the Barrens; the Horde starts in the Barrens and
	goes to Westfall. Then both go to Stonetalon Mountains, Loch Modan and Thoradin's
	Wall. Every quest starts and ends at an object you click; each needs level 14.

	A chain (`chain = true`): a quest done, or found done when the guide opens, ticks
	every step with no quest before it, so a player partway through opens the guide
	where they are.

	The quest ids, titles and spots are Wowhead's Forever database's (2026-10-15),
	kept in Tools/sleeping_bag.json, which the smoke test checks every quest step
	against. The collected data hasn't seen these quests yet, so the quest steps are
	`unverified`. The flight masters are Forever's own (/apg flights); the boats and
	zeppelins the Instance Journal's. Each route was planned by two planners, judged,
	checked against the data and fixed.

	Assumed known at the start: only the faction's capital flight points; any other
	is learned on the way, before the route flies to it.
]]

local function Register(def)
	local ok, why = AP:RegisterGuide(def)
	if not ok then geterrorhandler()(why) end
end

